        <briefdescription>
<para>Represents how an instruction should be mapped by the outliner. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput>Legal</computeroutput> instructions are those which are safe to outline. <computeroutput>LegalTerminator</computeroutput> instructions are safe to outline, but only as the last instruction in a sequence. <computeroutput>Illegal</computeroutput> instructions are those which cannot be outlined. <computeroutput>Invisible</computeroutput> instructions are instructions which can be outlined, but shouldn&apos;t actually impact the outlining result. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
